mcomix3 (3.6.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Updated application icon: single high-resolution source (615x615 mcomix-large.png)
    for the window icon, replacing multi-size subdirectory loading.
  * Added 256x256 icon to the system icon theme for crisp display in file managers.
  * Regenerated all small icons (16x16–48x48) from the high-res source via Lanczos.

